---
/**
 * Variant 1: Classic & Trustworthy
 * Traditional, professional medical design with classic blue tones
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Variante 1 - Klassisch | Mobile Kinderosteopathie Leipzig</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Merriweather:wght@400;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-primary: #1e4a7c;
      --color-primary-light: #2d6cb5;
      --color-primary-dark: #153657;
      --color-secondary: #f8f5f0;
      --color-accent: #c9a227;
      --color-text: #2c3e50;
      --color-text-muted: #5a6c7d;
      --color-background: #ffffff;
      --color-border: #d4dce4;
      --font-heading: 'Merriweather', Georgia, serif;
      --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      color: var(--color-text);
      background: var(--color-background);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      background: var(--color-background);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
      color: var(--color-primary);
      background: transparent;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-secondary) 0%, #e8e4dc 100%);
      padding: 80px 0 100px;
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    /* Trust Bar */
    .trust-bar {
      background: var(--color-primary);
      color: white;
      padding: 24px 0;
    }

    .trust-items {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .trust-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .trust-icon {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* USP Section */
    .usp-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: white;
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .usp-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .usp-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 32px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      background: white;
    }

    .usp-icon {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      background: var(--color-secondary);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }

    .usp-icon svg {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .usp-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .usp-card p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: var(--color-secondary);
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-image {
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4dce4 0%, #c8d0d8 100%);
      border: 4px solid white;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: var(--color-text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .credentials {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .credential-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .credential-item::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: var(--color-primary);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* CTA Section */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: var(--color-primary);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .cta-section p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .btn-white {
      background: white;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      padding: 14px 36px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .btn-white:hover {
      background: var(--color-secondary);
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: var(--color-primary-dark);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      padding: 48px 0 24px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .footer h4 {
      color: white;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .footer p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer-links {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-links li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      padding-top: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .back-link {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-accent);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: #b8911f;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .hero { padding: 60px 0 80px; }
      .usp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .trust-items { gap: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/project/designs" class="back-link">← Alle Varianten</a>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Susanne Hoppe</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Über mich</a>
        <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
        <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin anfragen</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-badge">MOBILE KINDEROSTEOPATHIE</span>
        <h1>Sanfte Behandlung für Ihr Kind – bei Ihnen zuhause</h1>
        <p>
          Als erfahrene Physiotherapeutin und zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin
          behandle ich Säuglinge und Kinder in ihrer vertrauten Umgebung in Leipzig.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin vereinbaren</a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Mehr erfahren</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <div class="trust-bar">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="trust-items">
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span>
          <span>20+ Jahre Erfahrung</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span>
          <span>Zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span>
          <span>Hausbesuche in Leipzig</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- USP Section -->
  <section class="usp-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Warum mobile Kinderosteopathie?</h2>
        <p>Professionelle osteopathische Behandlung in der entspannten Atmosphäre Ihres Zuhauses.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="usp-grid">
        <div class="usp-card">
          <div class="usp-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Behandlung zuhause</h3>
          <p>Ihr Kind wird in seiner vertrauten Umgebung behandelt – entspannter und ohne stressige Anfahrt.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="usp-card">
          <div class="usp-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Langjährige Erfahrung</h3>
          <p>Über 20 Jahre Erfahrung in der Arbeit mit Kindern als Physiotherapeutin und Osteopathin.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="usp-card">
          <div class="usp-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sanfte Methoden</h3>
          <p>Ausschließlich Behandlung von Kindern mit kindgerechten, sanften osteopathischen Techniken.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image">
          Foto Susanne Hoppe
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Über mich</h2>
          <p>
            Ich bin Susanne Hoppe, Physiotherapeutin und zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin
            mit über 20 Jahren Erfahrung in der Arbeit mit Kindern.
          </p>
          <p>
            Als mobile Osteopathin komme ich zu Ihnen nach Hause – damit Ihr Kind in seiner
            vertrauten Umgebung behandelt werden kann, entspannt und ohne Stress.
          </p>
          <div class="credentials">
            <div class="credential-item">Staatlich geprüfte Physiotherapeutin</div>
            <div class="credential-item">Zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin</div>
            <div class="credential-item">20+ Jahre Berufserfahrung</div>
          </div>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 24px;">Mehr über mich</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Haben Sie Fragen oder möchten einen Termin?</h2>
      <p>
        Ich freue mich auf Ihre Nachricht und beantworte gerne alle Fragen
        rund um die osteopathische Behandlung Ihres Kindes.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-white">Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>Susanne Hoppe</h4>
          <p>
            Mobile Kinderosteopathie in Leipzig.<br>
            Behandlung bei Ihnen zuhause.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Navigation</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Über mich</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Leistungen</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Kontakt</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Rechtliches</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Impressum</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Datenschutz</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        &copy; 2025 Susanne Hoppe. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
